# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# School ERP Mobile — environment configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env (or set in EAS build profiles / app config) and point the app
# at the correct LIVE backend. Example:
#
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.your-school-domain.com/api/v1
#
# Development default (when unset) is http://localhost:8000/api/v1 — this is a
# local-dev fallback only; production builds MUST set EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
